{"type":"message","id":"f0fb63a7","parentId":"85908015","timestamp":"2026-05-29T22:17:04.628Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It returns 200 with content-type text/plain and content-length 24, which is exactly \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\". So it's not actually sending the message, it's just returning the platform greeting.\n\nOK so the platform currently doesn't seem to have a working POST send endpoint. The only working endpoints are:\n- GET `/` - returns platform greeting\n- GET `/history?threadId=xxx&limit=n` - returns message history\n\nThere might be no working message send endpoint. Let me try one more time with different approaches - maybe there's a specific header needed or a different parameter format.\n\nLet me try with `Authorization: Bearer` header again since the GET `/history` works with `X-API-Key`.","thinkingSignature":"366c918ccf75831f01bcd3a1712e765fbc25745c8879054731e7a4a770f04414"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gqdkvxeohoc8_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with Authorization header instead\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat 22:15 UTC\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":140,"output":249,"cacheRead":78720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79109,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780093017888,"responseId":"0669435a110be3547b200f4589aa7157"}}
